• Implemented ROUND3 on `wip/spec-c9`. The worktree is clean, nothing was pushed, and `scripts/proofs/axioms.golden` is unchanged.

  ### Commits

  - `ffc8f93a3` Merge advanced `origin/wip/spec-core`
